00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:55.000
Contendency management is an interesting name because when I usually talk to people about it, they sort of think of talking about a crisis management strategy for a business. And of course, that makes sense. So contingency management, the reason that sort of has that name is the idea is that you're using contingencies or and it's really based on the theory of operant conditioning. So you're using sort of things from the environment to manage a behavior to help a person manage or change your behavior. So that's where it comes from.
权变管理（Contingency management）是一个有趣的名字，因为当我通常和人们谈论它时，他们会认为我们在谈论企业的危机管理策略。当然，这是合乎情理的。因此，权变管理之所以有这个名字，是因为其理念是你在使用权变因素（contingencies），它实际上基于操作性条件反射理论。所以，你是在使用环境中的某些事物来管理一种行为，以帮助一个人管理或改变他们的行为。这就是这个名字的由来。

